  "note": "Solid enemy bodies: one Synty POLYGON-rig character per roster slot with its weapon skinned into Hand_R and the sword-combat clips spliced in. Built by scripts/export-enemy-bodies.py into models/enemies/<realm>/; src/enemyBodies.json is regenerated from the result. Pack keys and weapon ids are those of scripts/weapons-manifest.json. `mesh` picks one character out of a pack-wide Characters.fbx. `weapons` are enemy-only pieces (a bow in Hand_L, a bomb, a staff) in the weapons-manifest shape; `attach` rides a bone; `clips` swaps in a body's own Polygon-rig FBX per clip.",
